msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And that “the archangel Michael came to me in a vision” stuff! I never expected "
"you to go there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E quella storia dell’arcangelo Michele apparso in una visione! Non mi sarei mai "
"aspettata una tale pensata."

