#: scenario8:scenario8_F00686CD_4142_4577_9D84_EE763D417ADA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b16e8f5861634f049676146d8f7751b5aca2c54fe57403c6b637d9e52afcea67
