msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Him giving us a room was not simply out of kindness.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Keeping me nearby "
"allows him to keep an eye on me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non ci ha dato una stanza per pura cortesia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il fatto che io rimanga nei "
"paraggi gli permette di⟪k:5⟫tenermi d’occhio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FE467025_F607_4DFF_AAAB_8B2043B0BA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3b5492887e4ed9c761023f03a7f91352cde38ced800dbd8eaa0b36afdba9060
#. default-sha256: e03061d2b4081c5f576e8c4675ab2206c78e265451a1ea8f8b2e3a8ce20635d3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FE467025_F607_4DFF_AAAB_8B2043B0BA2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do you really think he’ll do anything to hurt you?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mell’s a kind boy, "
"and... ⟪k:5⟫well, to be frank..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pensi davvero che possa farti del male?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mell è un ragazzo gentile, e... "
"⟪k:5⟫beh, francamente..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7D4C9075_65B0_4483_81F1_4BD3D726607F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07490c64c261b7b8897a6bec2dde5642699492152e13f56d74627fe727ddfa54
