msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Carelessly revealing our hand at this stage did not seem wise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esporci incautamente non è una mossa saggia."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2DC7E689_B590_4AEA_875D_FF5817E09A53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d83571ce7cf017a5c2d12d09bdfce561dfe7d3aae84e356943428077f6671a1
