msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It would have never gotten to this point if it were so easy to stop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se fosse stato facile fermare questa situazione,⟪k:3⟫non si sarebbe protratta "
"tanto a lungo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7DD7A39F_E523_460D_A79F_796093437290
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22bcba3f6e2f5db459279dba2c0927ac3d1482c6b1d37198e361ffdd75d4bf00
